cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its derived data, please cite it as below."
title: "Photosynthesis depletes its own enclosure: the Arabidopsis spaceflight response is measured in carbon-starved plants"
abstract: >-
  A validated lattice-Boltzmann model of leaf boundary-layer gas transport coupled to a
  Farquhar-von Caemmerer-Berry model of C3 photosynthesis, used to predict what an
  illuminated sealed spaceflight growth canister does to the CO2 reaching Rubisco, and
  tested against six matched flight-versus-ground contrasts in the NASA Open Science Data
  Repository. Includes an interactive browser implementation of the model.
type: software
